{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24848","headline":"宿陟岵寺云律师院 · 杨衡","name":"宿陟岵寺云律师院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"像宇郁参差，宝林疎复密。\n中有弥天子，燃灯坐虚室。\n心证红莲喻，迹羁青眼律。\n玉炉扬翠烟，金经开缥帙。\n肆陈坚固学，破我梦幻质。\n碧水洒尘缨，凉扇当夏日。\n宿禽讵相保，迸火烟欲失。\n愿回戚促劳，趋隅事休逸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}